        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tony Richardson, Giorgio Ferroni\n- Roles: film director, producer, theatre director, film editor, screenwriter\n- Topics: careers, credits, lifespan\n\nFacts:\n- Tony Richardson was born on 5 June 1928 and died on 14 November 1991.\n- Giorgio Ferroni was born on 12 April 1908 and died on 17 August 1981.\n- Tony Richardson was an English theatre and film director and producer whose career spanned five decades.\n- Giorgio Ferroni was an Italian film director, film editor, and screenwriter.\n- Giorgio Ferroni was sometimes credited as Calvin Jackson Padget or Calvin J. Padget.",
